#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:657
msgid "Navigating the graph guru"
msgstr "Navigera i diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:659
msgid ""
"Graphs in <application>Gnumeric</application> are created using the "
"<interface>Graph Guru</interface>. The process involved in using this 'guru'"
" essentially follows the alphabetical labels presented in <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application> skapas med "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>. Arbetet följer i stort sett de "
"bokstavsmarkerade områdena i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:669
msgid "Data Pre-selection"
msgstr "Förhandsmarkera data"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:670
msgid ""
"Advanced users generally start by pre-selecting at least some of the data "
"they will use in their plots. However, this step requires a complete "
"understanding graphs and this step is not described here. <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-preselect\"/> will explain data preselection once the "
"rest of the graphing process has been explained."
msgstr ""
"Avancerade användare börjar ofta med att markera en del av data i förväg för"
" sina rittyper. Det kräver dock att du redan förstår hur grafer är "
"uppbyggda, så det beskrivs inte här. <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-"
"preselect\"/> förklarar förhandsmarkering när resten av diagramarbetet har "
"gåtts igenom."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:683
msgid "Launching the Graph Guru"
msgstr "Öppna diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:684
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph guru</interface> can be started in two ways. One way to"
" start the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> is to click, with the primary "
"mouse button, on the toolbar graph button, <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject>"
" <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-graph.png\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase> The icon on the toolbar button which starts the graph "
"guru. </phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>. Another way is to "
"select, from the <guimenu>Insert</guimenu> menu, the "
"<guimenuitem>Chart...</guimenuitem> menu item. Both approaches will launch "
"the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> kan öppnas på två sätt. Ett sätt att "
"starta <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> är att klicka med den primära "
"musknappen på diagramknappen i verktygsfältet <inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-graph.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Ikonen på knappen i verktygsfältet som "
"öppnar diagramguiden.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>. Du kan "
"också välja i menyn <guimenu>Infoga</guimenu> menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Diagram...</guimenuitem>. Båda sätten öppnar "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:707
msgid "Selecting the plot type, sub-type, and style."
msgstr "Välja rittyp, undertyp och stil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:709
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph guru</interface> opens to the first of two panels. The "
"areas of this panel are shown in the left hand side of <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"graphguru-panels\"/>. This panel enables the user to select the type of the "
"first plot in the chart, and its sub-type and style. To make a graph with "
"multiple plots, a user should start by selecting the first plot; subsequent "
"plots can be added later."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> öppnas med den första av två paneler. "
"Områdena i panelen visas till vänster i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-"
"panels\"/>. Här väljer du diagrammets första rittyp, dess undertyp och stil."
" Om grafen ska innehålla flera rittyper väljer du först den första; du kan "
"lägga till fler senare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:722
msgid "Picking the plot type"
msgstr "Välja rittyp"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:723
msgid ""
"The first area, area <guimenu>A</guimenu>, provides a list of the plot "
"types. The user can pick one of the types by placing the mouse pointer on "
"top of that appropriate entry in the list and clicking the primary mouse "
"button. The blue highlight indicates which plot type has been chosen. The "
"characteristics of the different plot types are explained extensively in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview-types\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Det första området, <guimenu>A</guimenu>, visar en lista med rittyper. Välj "
"en typ genom att föra muspekaren till motsvarande post i listan och klicka "
"med den primära musknappen. Blå markering visar vilken rittyp som är vald. "
"Egenskaperna hos de olika rittyperna förklaras utförligt i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-overview-types\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:736
msgid "Picking the plot sub-type and style"
msgstr "Välja rittypens undertyp och stil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:737
msgid ""
"The second area of the first panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>,"
" labeled <guimenu>B</guimenu> in <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, "
"presents one or more icons. The icons presented in this area will change "
"depending on what plot type is highlighted in area <guimenu>A</guimenu>. The"
" icons provide a way to select a sub-type of plot, for example, the icons "
"for the column plot type provide the choice between plotting columns of each"
" data series side-by-side or plotting these columns stacked upon each other."
" These icons may also provide a way to quickly select different styles for "
"the plot type, for example the icons for the line type provide a choice "
"between plotting a simple line or placing markers at the points along the "
"line. The sub-type cannot be changed in the next panel of the "
"<interface>Graph Guru</interface> without deleting the plot and creating a "
"new one. However, the style choices can be altered in the next panel. The "
"meaning of each of these icons is explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-"
"overview-types\"/> below grouped by plot type. If data has been pre-"
"selected, clicking on the <guibutton>Show Sample</guibutton> will present a "
"preview of the plot type in area <guimenu>B</guimenu>."
msgstr ""
"Det andra området i <interface>Diagramguidens</interface> första panel, "
"märkt <guimenu>B</guimenu> i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, visar"
" en eller flera ikoner. Ikonerna ändras beroende på vilken rittyp som är "
"markerad i området <guimenu>A</guimenu>. Med dem väljer du en undertyp. För "
"kolumner kan du till exempel välja om dataseriernas kolumner ska stå bredvid"
" varandra eller staplas. Ikonerna kan också användas för att snabbt välja "
"stil. För linjer kan du exempelvis välja en enkel linje eller markörer vid "
"datapunkterna. Du kan inte ändra undertyp i "
"<interface>Diagramguidens</interface> nästa panel utan att ta bort rittypen "
"och skapa en ny. Däremot kan du ändra stilen där. Innebörden av ikonerna "
"beskrivs nedan under respektive rittyp i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-"
"overview-types\"/>. Om du har markerat data i förväg kan du klicka på "
"<guibutton>Visa exempel</guibutton> för att förhandsgranska rittypen i "
"området <guimenu>B</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:767
msgid "Moving to the next panel"
msgstr "Gå vidare till nästa panel"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:768
msgid ""
"Once a plot type has been chosen in area <guimenu>A</guimenu> and an icon "
"selected in area <guimenu>B</guimenu>, the first panel has been completed. "
"Clicking on the <guibutton>Forward</guibutton> button will dismiss the first"
" panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> and bring up the second "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"När du har valt en rittyp i området <guimenu>A</guimenu> och en ikon i "
"området <guimenu>B</guimenu> är den första panelen klar. Klicka på "
"<guibutton>Framåt</guibutton> för att stänga den första panelen i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> och öppna den andra."
